      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/traccatichthys_taeniatus_en/",
      "html": "<p>For the first time ever this pretty, red-finned loach could be imported from Vietnam. It has the popular name \"Peppermint Loach\" due to the bright green shine on the flanks. The species attains a length of about 12 cm and is very peaceful.</p>"
    },
